<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>用户注册 - 学途</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary: #2563eb;
            --secondary: #1e40af;
            --text-dark: #1e293b;
